    "c14": {
      "anchor": "not-yet#markdown-1",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "label": "14. Why not commit yet",
      "excerpt": "Spell aligns with ATSpaces now, and keeps a way out until it's ready. Its own wo",
      "text": "Table for this (but not for \"unknown\")",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-02T03:22:14.331Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "Its own words: breaking changes are coming, data may be lost, no security review, not for production.\nIts hosted alpha server is invite only, and is deleted when the alpha ends.\nUpgrades may not work: \"Do not expect that you'll even be able to cleanly upgrade between versions\".\nIt's a proposal, \"not the final specification\", hoping to launch later this year, with a beta around the end of November and no promised date.\nA host that dies probably takes its ATSpace data with it, as nothing mirrors it the way public records are.",
      "offset": 70,
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-02T03:26:22.423Z",
          "html": "<p>Done:  that list is now a table, and \"Unknown until it's run\" stays a list.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-02T03:25:58.326Z"
      }
    },
